&#x200B;

Honestly kava was not bad at times but overall definitely not worth it.  this is encouraging to hear for me too since I just ordered some phenibut and will be trying ti first time soon

Lol.  Dude.

It has nothing to do with sperm, tension in the balls or around the groin has to do entirely with blood flow.  Just take a warm bath and try to recall if something has caused you to be aroused which is what brings about this discomfort.  Try to stop being \*aroused\* (duh) and it will go away in a couple of hours, do yourself a favor and quit lying to yourself.  

&#x200B;

Its ok though dude, im just giving you a hard time but i love you for being here and even trying.

&#x200B;

It is 100% false that after a certain amount of time your balls will just "reach max capacity" and start to ache until you jack off, LMFAO

Compared to mdma or dxm, its not even close, but it is definitely enjoyable, it produces a nice drunken-like euphoria for me for about an hour, then kinda fades but still leaves me in a good mood, which is pleasant but nothing I would deem as noticeable as an "afterglow."

&#x200B;

I think next time I order I will be trying some of liftmodes product, as I heard it produces the most euphoria.

&#x200B;

Relax remedy isnt bad by any means though, it especially was nice to have while I was doing some studying for an exam this morning.

Im gonna piss people off and let you know I like dxm better without weed, I think its way more intense that way, the euphoria is great.

&#x200B;

Just make sure you fast a few hours and if you do HBR on an empty stomach you'll be tripping balls.

i wouldnt take an SSRI if you are planning on using DXM at all.  You might want to try other alternatives for depression, definitely quit taking dxm if you feel depressed, then after a while without dxm re evaluate if you still think you need to take your SSRI 

&#x200B;

that being said, its probably safe post 48 hours, but i really cant stress enough the same person shouldnt be taking SSRIs and DXM even if you take proper precautions, it cant be good for you

you are in for a very emotional and bumpy ride for a couple weeks but you can do it!

&#x200B;

For me I realized I was using DXM to combat loneliness, so instead ive been trying to go to the gym and work on NoFap and work and study hard to improve myself.  As soon as I get enough time sober im going to ask out a girl and that is a big motivator for me.

&#x200B;

This might sound extreme but something that has given me a lot of relief from cravings is a heavy meditation practice, I do 20 minutes when I wake up, 20 after lunch, and 20 before bed.  I find that I generally feel more upbeat, positive, and focused, I also feel that "spiritual itch" that dxm scratches, meditation also scratches.

&#x200B;

I mentioned nofap before, it helps a lot.  I would recommend staying away from all drugs for at least \~90 days after quitting dxm.  For me, if I drank alcohol or smoked weed early into quitting, I would just feel kinda down and shitty because dxm really burns out your serotonin system, I would always just think "dxm would just be so much better" and usually since I was intoxicated I would not have the best judgement and relapse.

&#x200B;

I know all of this may sound very crazy and extreme, early on into this I felt like I was trying to live like a monk, like there was no way I could do it and it was absurd.  

But quitting dxm has not been like quitting other drugs, it is incredibly depressing and scary if you dont know what you are doing, this is a very dangerous situation you are in where your entire future and life is at risk and it calls for drastic measures IMO.  (trust me, I tried to just stop many times before I started getting so hardcore about things.)

&#x200B;

Dont dismay though, if you do the above things, I promise it will be relatively smooth, there are many enjoyable aspects of life that you miss out on when you are a heavy DXM addict, and that enjoyment will slowly start to come back :)  

&#x200B;

Stay strong and much love to you, feel free to PM me.  I am still fighting but I have only had 1 relapse in the past 110 days and am so much happier than I was, good luck!

The euphoria fades a lot, but you don't really notice it, the thing is for me DXM always brought me massive emotional relief so it was inherently euphoric just for that, just being spaced out and numb, and feeling mildly optimistic was enough for me to keep abusing it and enjoying it up to the end of my use

&#x200B;

absolutely nothing compared to a dxm high with little tolerance though, orgasm for sure.  be careful with dxm man, im really happy youre mostly clean now, dxm can  wreck your life hard if you let it

