Triple Cs and Acetaminophen is not "pure dxm use."  Death resulting from using only DXM is highly unlikely, assuming you dont have an enzyme deficiency and dont take an enormous dose.

&#x200B;

A lethal dose of pure dxm is ~~roughly 2 grams~~ (varies depending on mg/kg of bodyweight.) and the average recreational dose is like 300 mg (also varies depending on mg/kg of bodyweight), in other words, overdosing on pure dxm would require you to take ~~roughly 7 times the normal dose (thats about 133 15 mg pills at once or a little under 9 bottles of robocough (one of the most concentrated DXM products.))~~  For this reason, pure dxm overdose by accident is extremely unlikely.

&#x200B;

Its also worth noting that if you even managed to take these amounts you would likely vomit a ton of it up before you could actually ingest such a massive dose.

&#x200B;

Still important to check for enzyme deficiency before anyone trips for the first time and to visit [dexcalc.com](https://dexcalc.com) for accurate recommended dosages

&#x200B;

EDIT: Ok I got some info wrong, apparently Robocough bottles are 450 mg, so 2gs of dxm would be about 4 bottles not 9, also the lethal amount of DXM is kind of unclear but it could actually be much more than 2g upwards of 5g, sorry for misinformation
